{"kind":"table","sheet":"90-Day Foundation","address":"A1:F21","rows":21,"cols":6,"values":[["90-Day Foundation Worksheet",null,null,null,null,null],["Write the real numbers down once. The goal is 90 days where survival is covered, decisions are reduced, and your energy can go into building.",null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null],["Category","Monthly Cost","90-Day Cost","Already Covered","Notes / What is included","Status"],["Housing",null,0,null,"Rent or mortgage, utilities, electricity, heating, water, required home insurance.",""],["Food and Water",null,0,null,"Groceries and drinking water. No delivery food, restaurants, or impulse spending.",""],["Health",null,0,null,"Health insurance, essential medication, hygiene, small medical emergency buffer.",""],["Reliable Communication",null,0,null,"Phone, internet, Wi-Fi, backup internet only if business would stop without it.",""],["Core Business Systems",null,0,null,"Domain, hosting, email, payment providers, CRM, essential AI/tools, accounting if needed.",""],["Mobility",null,0,null,"Fuel, insurance, leasing/loan, tolls, required maintenance only if genuinely necessary.",""],["Emergency Reserve",null,0,null,"10-15% buffer for repairs, unexpected bills, medication, or technical failures.",""],[null,null,null,null,null,null],["Summary","Value","Meaning",null,"Operating Rule",null],["Total 90-Day Foundation",0,"The full amount needed to remove survival pressure.",null,"A cost stays only if it keeps you alive, keeps your home stable, keeps you healthy, keeps you online, creates or protects revenue, or prevents a legal or financial problem. Everything else gets cancelled, paused, or frozen for 90 days.",null],["Current Cash Available",null,"Cash that can be used for this foundation now.",null,null,null],["Foundation Gap",0,"The exact amount still missing.",null,null,null],["Weekly Gap Target",0,"Gap divided across 12 weeks.",null,null,null],["First Action","Cancel, pause, earn, or collect one thing that protects the foundation.","One concrete move to close or protect the gap.",null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null],["Every second you spend fighting for survival is a second your mind cannot fully think about your business.",null,null,null,null,null]]}
